WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.085
Week 32: Work, Technology, and Formal Communication. summarize a meeting write a professional message explain a technical problem and next action

2
00:00:10.085 --> 00:00:17.289
Mission brief. Brief a supervisor on an outage, summarize stakeholder statements, and recommend next steps.

3
00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:26.694
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:26.694 --> 00:00:34.475
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:34.475 --> 00:00:43.002
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:43.002 --> 00:01:11.479
Model language. Voy a informar a mi supervisora sobre la avería. — I am going to inform my supervisor about the breakdown. Resumo las declaraciones de cada persona. — I summarize each person's statement. Explico todo detalladamente. — I explain everything in detail. Recomiendo el próximo paso. — I recommend the next step. Termino con una pregunta abierta. — I finish with an open question.

7
00:01:11.479 --> 00:01:21.377
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
